    "message": "Preserve unclassified free-ion inputs when no aqueous reading was assigned\n\nA failed aqueous owner withdraws assigned diagnostics. The unchanged native overdraw atomicity fixture has no solution characterization and requires its supplied free-ion hints to survive a rejected proposal. Keep that complete-state contract without retaining a real stale reading.\n\nSigned-off-by: crispasr integration <cze+github@mailbox.org>\n(cherry picked from commit 4fe2c947d9fa7edc2305d359bedc9f44fcacbea3)",
